fault high, xhigh), a <strong>unified 1M-token context window</strong> and long decode up to 1M tokens. The pricing page lists $3.00 input / $15.00 output (including thinking tokens) and $0.15 context caching, <strong>implicit caching only</strong> (explicit caching is not supported), with <strong>no free tier</strong>. No tiered pricing above 200K tokens is listed.<span class=\\\"tl-price-badge\\\">$3.00 / $15.00</span>\",\r\n  \"sec\": 60,\r\n  \"tag\": {\r\n   \"class\": \"google\",\r\n   \"label\": \"Google\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"links\": {\r\n   \"ja\": [\r\n    {\r\n     \"href\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/changelog\",\r\n     \"label\": \"公式リリースノート\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n     \"href\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\",\r\n     \"label\": \"料金ページ\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n     \"href\": \"/pricing/#gh\",\r\n     \"label\": \"料金比較\"\r\n    }\r\n   ],\r\n   \"en\": [\r\n    {\r\n     \"href\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/changelog\",\r\n     \"label\": \"Release notes\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n     \"href\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\",\r\n     \"label\": \"Pricing page\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n     \"href\": \"/en/pricing/#gh\",\r\n     \"label\": \"Pricing\"\r\n    }\r\n   ]\r\n  }\r\n },\r\n \"shown_on\": [\r\n  \"timeline\",\r\n  \"calculator\"\r\n ],\r\n \"sources\": [\r\n  {\r\n   \"url\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/changelog\",\r\n   \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-21\",\r\n   \"quote\": \"Gemini 4 Neon (gemini-4-neon) generally available (GA)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   \"url\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\",\r\n   \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-21\",\r\n   \"quote\": \"$3.00 per 1M input tokens and $15.00 per 1M output tokens\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   \"url\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\",\r\n   \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-21\",\r\n   \"quote\": \"Context caching price | Not available | $0.15 Implicit caching only (explicit caching is not supported).\"\r\n  }\r\n ],\