d, and Microsoft Azure&rdquo;); Mythos 5.2 is offered through the cyber and life-sciences validation programme. Batch input is $4 / MTok (50% of standard).<span class=\\\"tl-price-badge\\\">$8 / $40</span>\"\r\n },\r\n \"shown_on\": [\r\n  \"timeline\",\r\n  \"pricing\",\r\n  \"calculator\"\r\n ],\r\n \"sources\": [\r\n  {\r\n   \"url\": \"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2\",\r\n   \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-14\",\r\n   \"quote\": \"available at a lower price: $8 per million input tokens and $40 per million output tokens\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   \"url\": \"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/fable-5-2/overview\",\r\n   \"fetched_at\": null,\r\n   \"quote\": null\r\n  }\r\n ],\r\n \"events\": []\r\n}\r\n\nError: "}], "toolUseId": "call_00_DoA0ySlWGVNMHS4ILFL84468"}